sequenceDiagram
    title Merchant Onboarding — Happy Path (JRN-018)

    actor Merchant as Merchant (PER-007)
    actor Staff as Bank Staff (PER-059)
    participant CH001 as Web Portal (CH-001)
    participant CH005 as Internal Tooling (CH-005)
    participant CAP002 as CAP-002 Commercial Banking API
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005 Compliance & Regulatory API
    participant CAP003 as CAP-003 Payment Operations API
    participant EB as Event Bus
    participant SVC103 as Audit & Logging (SVC-103)

    note over Merchant, SVC103: PH-093 — Merchant Application and KYC

    Merchant->>CH001: Submit merchant application
    CH001->>CAP002: POST /merchant-applications
    CAP002-->>CH001: 201 Created — application_id
    CAP002->>EB: MerchantApplicationSubmitted (EVT-130)
    EB->>CAP005: Deliver MerchantApplicationSubmitted (EVT-130)
    note over CAP005: KYC/AML screening + sanctions checks
    CAP005->>EB: MerchantKYCCompleted (EVT-131) — CLEAR
    EB->>CAP002: Deliver MerchantKYCCompleted (EVT-131)

    note over Merchant, SVC103: PH-094 — Credit Risk and Chargeback Assessment

    CAP002->>SVC103: Log credit assessment
    note over CAP002: Internal credit assessment (SVC-005 → SVC-008)
    CAP002->>EB: MerchantCreditAssessmentCompleted (EVT-132) — APPROVED

    note over Merchant, SVC103: PH-095 — PCI DSS Compliance Assessment

    Merchant->>CH001: Submit PCI DSS SAQ
    CH001->>CAP002: Submit SAQ
    CAP002->>EB: PCIDSSAssessmentCompleted (EVT-133) — COMPLIANT

    note over Merchant, SVC103: PH-096 — Approval and Scheme Registration

    Staff->>CH005: Approve merchant
    CH005->>CAP002: POST /merchant-applications/{id}/approve
    CAP002->>EB: MerchantApproved (EVT-134)
    EB->>CAP003: Deliver MerchantApproved (EVT-134)
    note over CAP003: Register with Visa + Mastercard
    CAP003->>EB: MerchantSchemeRegistered (EVT-136)
    EB->>CAP002: Deliver MerchantSchemeRegistered (EVT-136)

    note over Merchant, SVC103: PH-097 — Terminal Provisioning and Go-Live

    CAP002->>EB: MerchantTerminalProvisioned (EVT-135)
    note over CAP002: Test transaction processed
    CAP002->>EB: MerchantLive (EVT-137)
